    "detailed_description": "<strong>Game Overview.</strong><br>A click-based school adventure game.<br>You are a member of the school's detective club and struggle to uncover the truth behind a case.<br>The game system has a simple yet retro atmosphere.<br>A full-length mystery adventure story that will take you into the vortex of the case.<br><br><strong>Story.</strong><br>&quot;I need your help to find my brother.&quot;<br>The main character belongs to the Tsukumikou High School Detective Club.<br>Kaede Satomori, a classmate, comes to him for advice.<br><br>While searching for her brother, the main character and her friends find<br>They find the body of a woman holding a badge of &quot;Kogane-mushi&quot; (a gold bug).<br><br>The strange rumors whispered in the school, the secret of the mysterious Kogane-mushi, and the mysterious incidents that occur around the protagonist, all lead to the discovery of the &quot;Kogane-mushi&quot;.<br>And the mysterious incidents that occur around the main character.<br>It is the beginning of the tragedy surrounding the incident of 10 years ago...!",
